        "wrong_word": "are",
        "correct_word": "is",
        "fixed_sentence": "There is a bakery and a pharmacy around the corner.",
        "reason": "『There is / There are』採「就近原則」，緊鄰的第一個名詞『a bakery』是單數，因此必須用『There is』！"
